      "title": "Hybrid enterprise network",
      "description": "An invented retailer, Northwind Traders. Staff at the Manchester head office and four branches reach the ERP in the Leeds data centre over SD-WAN, through firewall pairs and a spine-and-leaf server farm. Customers reach the web shop through a DMZ, and a site-to-site VPN carries the nightly export to an AWS warehouse.",
